 <h3><u>Qafla aagaya</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haan...<br> Haaye sughra..(4)<br> Palte zindaa'n se jis waqt ehle haram<br> aur nazdeek e yasrab huwe mehwe ghum<br> haye sughra,<br> sughra ne khabar jab paayi<br> wo ghar se nikal aayi<br> Deti huwi sadaa...<br> aao ehle madina aao, phool barsao nazrein bichhao<br> saare yasrab ki galiyaa'n sajao..(2)<br> ab charagha yahaa'n..(2) bemisaal karo<br> mere baba ka istaqbaal karo..(2)<br> qafla aagaya..(3)<br> Mere baba ka...<br> qafla aagaya</p> 
  <p>1. Guzrenge jahan se baba mere, mehkao wo galiya'n saari<br> tum unpe nichawar jaan karo,<br> hojau mai sadqe waari..(2)<br> is ghar ki bahaare lekar, wo dekho mere darr par<br> qafla aagaya..(3)<br> mere baba ka..<br> qafla aagaya</p> 
  <p>2. Lo aaj phire din sughra ke, kehte hai sabhi do raahe<br> kal zinda laash ke jaisi thi<br> ab jeene ko dil chaahe..(2)<br> lo badla naseeb is ghar ka, ham shakle payambar ka<br> qafla aagaya..(3)<br> mere akbar ka<br> qafla aagaya</p> 
  <p>3. Ek saal huwa veeran huwe, aaghosh meri aur pehlu<br> ab laut ke aate hai asghar<br> aur dil pe nahi hai qaabu..(2)<br> aai hai meri maadar bhi, hai godi mein asghar bhi<br> qafla aagaya..(3)<br> mere asghar ka<br> qafla aagaya</p> 
  <p>4. Ab chayn se soyega yasrab, na khauf hai na veerani<br> laut aaye safar se ghar apne<br> wo shere khuda ka saani..(2)<br> mash'hoor hai jo taaqat mein, lo unki qayadat mein<br> qafla aagaya..(3)<br> mere ghaazi ka<br> qafla aagaya</p> 
  <p>5. Nagaah sada sughra suni, kehti hai ali ki beti<br> &nbsp;bekaar hai tera khush hona<br> ujdi hai ye sayyed zaadi..(2)<br> haye karbobala mein lutkar, zindaa'n se reha hokar<br> qafla aagaya..(3)<br> tere baba ka..<br> qafla aagaya</p> 
  <p>6. Mat soch ke aaye hai baba, mat soch ke aaye akbar<br> darya pe chacha sota hai tera<br> jungle mein hai tera asghar..(2)<br> roti hai lahu ye aankhein, ek qaidi ke saaye mein<br> qafla aagaya..(3)<br> tere baba ka...<br> qafla aagaya</p> 
  <p>7. Ghum aur khushi ke pehlu hai, kya dard bhara hai manzar<br> rota hai lahu irfan e azaa<br> alfaaz bhi tere mazhar..(2)<br> zainab ne kaha ghabrake, masooma ko dafna ke<br> qafla aagaya..(5)</p> 
